    "https://career.sites.clemson.edu/cooperative_education/": {
      "title": "Cooperative Education Program (Co-op)",
      "description": "Cooperative Education Program (Co-op) – Center for Career and Professional Development | Clemson University Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Search Keywords Log in Sign up Guests Clemson Home ClemsonJobLink Make an Appointment Request a Workshop Contact Us How do I… Develop Resumes, CVs & Cover Letters Search for a Job or Internship Explore Majors & Careers Prepare for an Interview Prepare for Graduate School Expand My Network Research Salaries & Negotiate Offers Enroll in the Cooperative Education Program Grow in Core Competencies Reserve an Interview Room Visit the Career Closet Visit the Career Innovation Lab View Recorded Workshops Students Undergraduate Students Graduate Students First Year Alumni Alumni Career Paths Accounting & Finance Agriculture, Food & Natural Resources Architecture & Construction Arts, Audio/Video Technology & Communications Business Management & Administration Education & Training Engineering & Technology Government & Public Administration Health Science Hospitality & Tourism Human Services Information Technology Law & Policy Marketing Operations & Logistics Science & Mathematics CCPD Programs Career Services Cooperative Education Program (Co-op) On-Campus Internships (UPIC) Off-Campus Internships International Internship Program Internship Prep Program | Tigers on Track Partners Employers Corporate Partners Faculty & Staff Parents & Families About Us Mission & Vision Meet the Team Outcomes & Data Visit the CCPD Frequently Asked Questions Clemson University Home Featured Articles Career Resources Career Resources Featured Jobs Featured Internships Featured Internships Search for Jobs Labor Market Insights Cooperative Education Program (Co-op) Are you ready to take part in one of the top Co-op Programs in the country? The Cooperative Education Program (Co-op Program) is a dynamic academic program that offers students the opportunity to develop professional skill sets prior to graduation.  Clemson’s Co-op Program is widely recognized as one of the top in the country! New Students Frequently Asked Questions about our program and matching process Current Students Information about the Co-op assignments, iRoar, Financial Aid, and the SteelFab Grant Co-op Sponsors Check out the partner companies that support our program! Featured Sponsor! Learn about the current featured sponsor’s history with Clemson Co-op and see how they support our students’ career development. Employers Is your company ready to become a Co-op Teaching Partner? Information for current and prospective companies is right here. Co-op Events See what events are coming up this year for Clemson Co-op! Both employers and students will want to mark their calendars. Benefits of participating in the Co-op Program: Co-op students work and learn under a mentor in their field of study Company partners invest more training and resources in co-op students Co-op students are guaranteed on-campus interviews Most co-op students complete 6-12 interviews through the matching process All co-op assignments are paid Co-op advisors monitor student experiences to ensure they are high-impact and educationally relevant Students perceive their education to be more relevant and have greater educational persistence Contact Us Connect on LinkedIn Career Resources Graduate School Grant – STEM  Internship with Industry Share This: Share Graduate School Grant – STEM  Internship with Industry on Facebook Share Graduate School Grant – STEM  Internship with Industry on LinkedIn Share Graduate School Grant – STEM  Internship with Industry on X Copy Link STEM Graduate Student Summer 2026 Internship with Industry\nApplications are open! Students who will be completing a paid or unpaid … Read More SCBio Foundation Summer Internship Grant Application Share This: Share SCBio Foundation Summer Internship Grant Application on Facebook Share SCBio Foundation Summer Internship Grant Application on LinkedIn Share SCBio Foundation Summer Inte