ining and Development Overview Managing Employee Development Supervisor Training and Development Team and Organizational Development Compensation Managing Workplace Concerns show submenu for Managing Workplace Concerns Managing Workplace Concerns Overview Reporting Discrimination, Harassment or Retaliation Staff and Faculty Relations Services Staff Misconduct Faculty Misconduct Drug and Alcohol Testing Managing Transition and Separation Benefits and Wellness show submenu for Benefits and Wellness Benefits and Wellness Overview Employee Discounts and Perks State Insurance Benefit Plans show submenu for State Insurance Benefit Plans State Insurance Benefit Plans Overview Your Employee Benefits Package State Insurance Plan Options Interactive Benefits Overview PEBA MyBenefits Login PEBA Health Perks and Resources Retirement Changes: Major Life Events show submenu for Changes: Major Life Events Changes: Major Life Events Overview Resources for Pregnancy, Childbirth and Related Conditions Holidays and Leave show submenu for Holidays and Leave Holidays and Leave Overview Holiday Schedule Summary of Leave Benefits Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA) Kronos Information Employee Assistance Program Employee Wellness show submenu for Employee Wellness Employee Wellness Overview Financial Wellness Clemson Rural Health Campus Recreation Outdoor Wellness Activities Employee Tuition Assistance Program Logins and Resources show submenu for Logins and Resources Logins and Resources Overview Logins show submenu for Logins Logins Overview Workday Tiger Training OnBase-Performance Contact HR HR Service Center Forms and Resource Library Policies and Procedures Employment Verification Payroll Timekeeping Information Clemson Home Office of Human Resources Careers Current: Why Choose Clemson #1 in South Carolina Join A Top Institution Clemson University has again been named the top national public university in South Carolina in the 2024 U.S. News and World Report annual rankings.\n\nAt Clemson, we believe in the power of hard work, and we pursue that work tirelessly. \nWe believe that our collective calling as a University is to change lives, change perceptions, and through our work, change the world. Apply Today Dedication to Statewide Service Clemson has operations in all 46 South Carolina counties, with six Research and Education Centers and five Innovation Campuses across the state. These locations provide specialized facilities where faculty, staff and students can conduct research and advance partnerships that advance our state. Learn More A Place to Advance “ “I’m grateful to work alongside such dedicated colleagues at Clemson University Libraries. Their commitment to fostering a world-class learning environment and contributing to the #1 student experience in the nation, aligned with Clemson’s mission as a leading public research University, is unparalleled.” Shamella Cromartie Associate Dean, Organizational Performance and Administration University Libraries Clemson's Commitment to Staff and Faculty Professional Development Clemson is dedicated to helping employees develop both personally and professionally. Through Tiger Training, each employee is provided with specialized courses to promote growth in their position. In addition to University training courses, Clemson employees are encouraged to pursue their goals with access to special events and development programs. Employee Training and Development Tuition Assistance The Clemson University Tuition Assistance Program empowers eligible faculty and staff members to earn as many as six college credits per semester at no cost or a reduced cost. Employee Tuition Assistance Program (ETAP) Work-Life Balance Clemson is committed to providing various programs to ensure all employees are successful at work and in life. Clemson provides a variety of leave options, including Paid Parental Leave. Leave Summary Childcare We understand you may need to find a childcare provider or facility that you can trust when you arrive at Clemson. The list below provides childcare options throughout the Upstate, grouped by city. Childcare Options (PDF) Employee Health and Wellness Clemson is committed to helping employees maintain a healthy lifestyle by providing a robust benefits package and extensive wellness programming. Benefits Information Wellness at Clemson Supporting Our Military Our mission is to support, recognize, and advocate for military members and veterans in order to build a stronger workforce at Clemson University. Supporting Our Military A great place to work in one of the most beautiful places on earth Clemson is conveniently located near popular lakes, the beautiful Blue Ridge Mountains, and one of America's best places to live, Greenville, SC. Living in Upstate South Carolina Office of Human Resources Copyright © Clemson University Office of Human Resources | 108 Perimeter Rd, Clemson, SC 29634 Contact Us intro-arrow Engage With Us Through Instagram - Office of Human Resources Twitter - Office of Human Resources LinkedIn - Office of Human Resources Clemson University Facebook Instagram Twitter/X Linkedin Youtube Policy Accessibility Title IX Non-Discrimination & Anti-Harassment Policy Ethics/Safety\n    \t\t\t\t\t\t\tHotline Privacy Statement Copyright © 2026 Clemson University • Clemson, South Carolina 29634 Clemson University Clemson University Facebook Clemson University Instagram Clemson University Twitter/X Clemson University Linkedin Clemson University Youtube Resources A-Z Index Campus Map CU Safety Directory Webcams Apply to\n    \t\t\t\t\t\t\tClemson"
