    "https://iptaycuad.com/careers/": {
      "title": "Careers",
      "description": "Careers – IPTAY About Us Our Mission Message From IPTAY CEO Welcome to IPTAY Articles Of Incorporation IPTAY Bylaws Public Financial Documents Compliance FAQ’s Our Team Staff Directory IPTAY Board of Directors IPTAY Student Advisory Board Connect With Us Social Media IPTAY Student Advisory Board Contact Information & Form IPTAY REP Volunteer Program IPTAY Student Employment Careers Membership & Benefits Giving Opportunities Annual Fund Block C Club IPTAY YA (Young Alumni) Collegiate Club Tiger Cub Club Giving Levels & Benefits Giving Levels Membership Guide IPTAY Loyalty Discount Program My Orange Update Orange: The Experience Credential Packet IPTAY Priority Points Tickets & Parking Football Tickets & Parking Information Buy Tickets Basketball Tickets & Parking Information Buy Tickets Olympic Sports Tickets & Parking Information Buy Tickets Premium Seats Memorial Stadium North & South Suites Younts South Club Lewis and Marie Miller Family WestZone Club Masters Club Littlejohn Coliseum Mathis Family Club (Coliseum Club) Courtside Club Loge Premium Seats Gymnastics Matside Seating Gymnastics – Mathis Family Club Doug Kingsmore Stadium Field Level Seats Ways To Give Giving Opportunities Annual Fund Major Gifts IPTAY Legacy Support Your Sport Other Ways To Give How To Give Online By Phone Membership Application Stock Matching Gift Program Scheduled Payment Plan Clemson Payroll Deduction Contact Donate Now My Account Open Mobile Menu Header Search Careers Be a part of the POWER behind the Paw! IPTAY has been supporting the success of the Clemson Tigers since 1934 and is a committed to stewarding the investments of generations of loyal, generous contributors to Clemson athletics. Our team is driven by our rich history, unwavering mission, and the opportunity to transform lives through an unmatched collegiate student-athlete experience. Hiring the very best and most talented people is key to sustaining our excellent work environment propelling  IPTAY and Clemson athletics to excel on the biggest and brightest stages. We offer a competitive compensation package which includes: Affordable Wellness Plan: Receive generous health, dental, and vision insurance benefits for you and your eligible dependents at affordable rates. Future Security: Receive contributions toward an employee 401(k) retirement plan. 10% Employer Contribution; 5% Employee Contribution. Recharge: Generous time off with holiday, vacation, and sick leave. Peace of Mind: Several voluntary benefit plans include additional life insurance, vision, long-term disability, short-term disability, accident protection, critical illness, and flexible spending accounts. Life Learning: Tuition assistance plan for classes at Clemson University. Give Back: In keeping with our land-grant mission, three days of paid leave are offered to volunteer and pursue further education offerings. IPTAY © 2024 Clemson University. All rights reserved. Contact Us FAQ Privacy Policy Powered by WAYS TO GIVE IPTAY Annual Fund IPTAY Major Gifts Block C Club IPTAY Legacy info Giving Levels & Benefits IPTAY YA! Collegiate Club Tiger Cubs/CATS contact us Staff Directory Board of Directors Contact Us"
    },
